  "title": "&#34;Special&#34; Roasted Potatoes",
  "description": "Chef John&#39;s recipe for yellow potatoes involves boiling them in seasoned water, then oven-roasting them with olive oil and kosher salt until crusty.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
